Licensing overview
==================

This is a mixed-license derivative, not a blanket MIT-licensed firmware project.
The complete inherited bridge terms are retained in firmware/LICENSE.TXT and
source headers. Dependency notices are retained in LICENSES/.

Original project additions (desktop Python tools, project-specific firmware
additions, tests and new documentation), excluding copied/derived third-party
portions, are available under the MIT terms in LICENSES/project-additions-MIT.txt.
This does not relicense any upstream work or override its restrictions.

The BlueKitchen source headers include a personal/non-commercial condition.
The Raspberry Pi supplemental license covers the listed Raspberry Pi products.
Do not assume this repository grants commercial rights or use on arbitrary boards.
Review the exact applicable texts before redistributing or changing hardware.

See THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md for provenance and component-specific information.
